            "value": [
              "Based on convenience sampling, eight regular primary schools from the Netherlands were invited to participate. This yielded 346 participants, but due to incomplete data from two individuals the final sample consisted of 344 participants. The group consisted of 192 girls (55.8%) and 152 boys (44.2%), with 168 fifth-grade (48.8%) and 176 sixth-grade students (51.2%)."
